For the first few weeks of playing 3.x I was convinced that it was much
too difficult.  Rings of conflict and wands of polymorph have changed my
opinion (and others it seems).  I think the following changes would bring
these two objects back in line with others.

1) rings of conflict should cause conflict between ALL characters including
   you (me / us / ...).  It would bring some strategy into wearing it.  Your
   dog would not be very friendly, walking into a store would be rather
   dangerous and you cant sit in a throne room relaxing.  I think this
   change would be an easy one.

2) wands of polymorph should not be able to create special object (named
   weapons, wishing anythings). Other objects/monsters/pets should be subject
   to damaging/destructive system shocks.  The change may also be temporary
   though I dont think that is feasible for monsters polymorphed into food
   and then consumed (A Dragon corpse bursts out of your stomach. Unwise
   eating decision!!!) [ That reminds me... why should I die when eating a
   Medusa?  I thought that viewing a Medusa was fatal, but I was blindfolded
   at the time ]
